<p>imaa'n ki jaan kya hai mohabbat ali ki hai<br />
raahat jo qabr ki hai wo ulfat ali ki hai<br />
saail bakaf hai sab wo saqaawat ali ki hai<br />
qaatil ko di amaa'n wo murawwat ali ki hai</p>

<p>aadil ho, peshwa ho, madaarul mahaam ho<br />
gar ho nabi ke baad to aisa imam ho<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sadqe ghulam teri musibat ke ya ali<br />
aye jaanashi'n janabe risalat ke ya ali<br />
qurbaa'n lahu bhari teri surat ke ya ali<br />
ayyam hai ye teri shahadat ke ya ali</p>

<p>ye zulm be jehat ye sitam be sabab huwa<br />
talwar tere sar pa lagi kya ghazab huwa<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>unniswi'n(19) se aapka maatam hai ya ali<br />
qoo'n hogaye dilo'n ka ye aalam hai ya ali<br />
daftar jaha'n ka darham-o-barham hai ya ali<br />
maahe siyam maahe muharram hai ya ali</p>

<p>moula ki nazr ko gohar-e ashk laaye hai<br />
ye rozedaar aapke purse ko aaye hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>moula shigaafta huwa sajde me sar tera<br />
syed tabah hogaya kufe me ghar tera<br />
sarwar alam dilo'n ko hai shaam-o- sahar tera<br />
aaqa inhi dino'n me huwa tha safar tera</p>

<p>aalam se be qabar the quzu-o qushu me<br />
talwar jab lagi thi jhuke the ruku me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ghar me quda ke qatl hua rozedaar haaye<br />
hai hai imaam haaye shahe zulfeqaar haaye<br />
aye qaana zaad haq shahe taa'at guzaar haaye<br />
moulud haram me hai to najaf me mazaar haaye<br />

<p>ye bandagi nisaare janaabe ameer ke<br />
nikle to ghar se mar ke quda e qadeer ke<br />
_________________________________</p>

<p>laaya tha zehar me wo jafa joo bujha ke tegh<br />
moula gire zameen pa sajde me khake tegh<br />
ghul padhgaya ke sar pa lagi murtaza ke tegh<br />
khaayi quda ke sher ne ghar me quda ke tegh</p>

<p>gehra hai zaqm farqe imame hijaaz par<br />
sar se tapak raha hai lahu jaa-namaz par<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>shera khuda jo haato'n se thaame the apna sar<br />
qoo'n dono kohniyo'n se tapakta tha qaak par<br />
bhaaga jo ibn-e muljim-e maloon-o bad siyar<br />
pakda use ali ke muhibbo'n ne doud kar</p>

<p>laaye jo haath baandh ke moula ke saamne<br />
qaatil pa muskura ke nazar ki imaam ne<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>farmaya mai ne kounsi ki thi teri qataa<br />
paadaash nekiyo'n ki yahi hai jaha'n me kya<br />
kya mai bura imaam tha aye baniye jafaa<br />
roya jo sar jhuka ke to moula ne ye kaha</p>

<p>is dard me bhi sab ke maraz ki dawa hai ham<br />
baandho na iske haath ke mushkil kusha hai ham<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>dono shabe'n ali ko tadapte huwi basar<br />
lete the is taraf kabhi karwat kabhi udhar<br />
rokar dabaate pau'n jo shabbir-e- naamwar<br />
reh jaate the imaam-e- do alam hilake sar</p>

<p>rudaad thi nazar me mujassam hussain ki<br />
awaaz sun ke rote the zainab ke bain ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>jab bees-wi ka din bhi tadapkar huwa tamaam<br />
ummul banee'n se chounk ke kehne lage imaam<br />
do din se aah sab mere bache hai be ta-aam<br />
faaqe me in-pe guzregi kya aaj ki bhi shaam</p>

<p>accha hu ab to mai ye abas be qaraar hai<br />
khana inhe khilao ke sab rozedaar hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bole hussain baap se haato'n ko jod kar<br />
sab khaae'n phir jo aap tanaawul kare'n agar<br />
farmaya rizq uth gaya majboor hai pidar<br />
paani bhi ab gale se utarta nahi pisar</p>

<p>daawat ali ki aaj hai ghar me ilaah ke<br />
roza khulega saath risalat panah ke<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>chup hogaye ye kehke shahinshah-e kaayenat<br />
samjhe ye sab ke ghash me hai shah-e- nik-o sifaat<br />
jis waqt baaqi rehgayi kuch kam ghadi wo raat<br />
teghe ajal ne qata kiya rishta-e- hayaat</p>

<p>tadka tha noor ka ke safar kar gaye ali<br />
sab shia be imaam huwe mar gaye ali<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>